      "step_id": 0,
      "title": "Prepare 2x RNA loading dye",
      "instruction": "Combine the following components to make 2× RNA loading dye (without fluorescent stain): 95 % (v/v) deionized formamide, 0.025 % (v/v) SDS, 0.5 mM EDTA, 0.1 % (w/v) xylencyanole, and 0.1 % (w/v) bromophenol blue. Mix thoroughly.",
